{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/sitinme/status/2100761248011096423","id":"2100761248011096423","text":"https://x.com/i/article/2100394871265820672","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/QGnw2pyXVq","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[0,23],"original":"https://t.co/QGnw2pyXVq","replacement":"https://x.com/i/article/2100394871265820672","display":"x.com/i/article/2100…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"sitinme","url":"https://x.com/sitinme","id":"830429456","followers":31811,"following":508,"likes":112,"media_count":2454,"name":"sitin","description":"增长黑客/ 社群运营/AI 出海赚美刀\n做了几十个站，已实现月入 10K 美金，\n有个品牌站，http://hiapi.ai\n擅长用AI搞点副业 / vx： 257735","raw_description":{"text":"增长黑客/ 社群运营/AI 出海赚美刀\n做了几十个站，已实现月入 10K 美金，\n有个品牌站，https://t.co/bvUDQJfX3u\n擅长用AI搞点副业 / vx： 257735","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[47,70],"original":"https://t.co/bvUDQJfX3u","replacement":"http://hiapi.ai","display":"hiapi.ai"}]},"location":"","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/3569591888/2aad771c0c1919fb7577a7b625a93d0a_200x200.jpeg","joined":"Tue Sep 18 05:39:32 +0000 2012","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://hiapi.ai","display_url":"hiapi.ai"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":6,"retweets":1,"likes":10,"bookmarks":14,"quotes":1,"created_at":"Fri Sep 18 01:38:06 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1789695486,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":3895,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"article":{"created_at":"2026-09-18T01:38:06.000Z","modified_at":"2026-09-29T02:08:23.000Z","id":"2100394871265820672","title":"Agents API来了，Codex背后的这套能力终于开放了","preview_text":"很多 AI 留在聊天框里，只能告诉你代码应该怎么改。\n到了 Codex 这里，它却能自己读取项目、修改文件、运行测试，把一项工作继续做几个小时。\n这中间到底多了什么？\n9 月 10 日，OpenAI 宣布 Agents API 进入 public","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHSYbgj8bwAAKAAIAAAAAMX9ZEAAA","media_id":"2100396522433396736","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":80.68,"rgb":{"blue":235,"green":243,"red":247}},{"percentage":5.22,"rgb":{"blue":235,"green":205,"red":179}},{"percentage":5.13,"rgb":{"blue":208,"green":237,"red":248}},{"percentage":3.86,"rgb":{"blue":131,"green":125,"red":124}},{"percentage":2.7,"rgb":{"blue":68,"green":55,"red":51}}]},"original_img_height":669,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSYbgj8bwAA4f4g.jpg","original_img_width":1672},"media_key":"3_2100396522433396736"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2r48r","text":"很多 AI 留在聊天框里，只能告诉你代码应该怎么改。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8csoo","text":"到了 Codex 这里，它却能自己读取项目、修改文件、运行测试，把一项工作继续做几个小时。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"75dl0","text":"这中间到底多了什么？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"89mod","text":"9 月 10 日，OpenAI 宣布 Agents API 进入 public beta（公测），把支撑 Codex 的同一套 harness 和基础设施通过 API 带给开发者。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bv1p4","text":"要讲清楚这件事，我先给一个便于理解的简化拆法：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":35,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"a0cdd","text":"Agent ≈ Model（大模型） + Harness（运行框架）。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"drk8n","text":"Model 负责思考、理解、推理和决策。你给它一段需求，它可以分析问题、生成代码，也可以判断下一步应该做什么。但模型本身并不知道项目文件放在哪里，也不会自动打开终端运行测试。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":25,"offset":60,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"at9bh","text":"Harness 负责组织上下文、工具调用、状态和子 Agent，并让模型通过工具访问具体的执行环境。它运行这样一个循环：模型判断 → 调用工具 → 读取结果 → 继续判断。模型在这个循环里不断根据真实结果调整下一步，才有可能把一个目标持续推进下去。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"86e7j","text":"所以，Agent 想连续干活，需要 Harness 和一个可操作的执行环境。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fsk70","text":"谁来保存任务状态？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dpu1n","text":"谁把文件、终端和浏览器交给它？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k0gd","text":"工具调用失败以后从哪里继续？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b00pp","text":"任务太大时，怎样拆给不同的子 Agent？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"94m99","text":"最后又怎样留下过程，让人检查它到底做了什么？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"76sp","text":"Harness 负责组织 Agent 配置、Session、上下文、工具调用和执行环境。文件、终端等操作，则实际运行在具体的执行环境里。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"840v7","text":"Model 像负责思考的大脑，Harness 像连接工作流程的调度层和任务管理系统；两者合在一起，再配合具体执行环境，才形成能接到目标后持续行动的 Agent。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"chke","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4o7i3","text":"现在，我们可以通过 Agents API，把 Codex 这种“接到任务以后继续往下干”的工作方式放进自己的产品。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":21,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"3fii8","text":"01　Harness 把模型接到真实工作上","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4b4rf","text":"把这个简化关系分清以后，再回头看 Codex，差别就很明显了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"444pg","text":"一个模型再聪明，如果只有聊天框，能做的事情依然有限。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ri1h","text":"你问一句，它回答一句。需要文件时你上传，需要运行代码时你自己复制，需要继续上次的工作时，你还得重新交代背景。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4pq96","text":"有了 Harness，模型周围会多出一整套工作条件：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bgsop","text":"它知道当前要完成什么；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9ujrf","text":"它能读取文件和使用工具；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b14ol","text":"它能看到任务进行到了哪里；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"coso8","text":"工作太多时，可以拆给几个子 Agent；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ddtk9","text":"中间失败以后，可以根据已有状态继续；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ag9hq","text":"最后留下文件、记录和可以检查的结果。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bc1c6","text":"所以 Codex 的价值，不只是“这个模型很会写代码”。它还有一个真实工作现场。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5m22t","text":"它可以进入项目，读取资料，运行命令，修改文件，再打开结果检查。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"26b7m","text":"把这些能力组织起来的运行框架，就是 Harness。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":17,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"cc17f","text":"02　长任务并不是让 AI 一直想","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9fdlk","text":"很多人会把“长任务”理解成让模型一次思考几个小时。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"17u15","text":"但真正的长任务，更像我们平时做项目。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4qtjk","text":"先理解目标，再拆分步骤；做到一半发现问题，就回去修改；需要其他资料时，再补充输入；最后还要检查结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b1vtm","text":"比如，给一个维护了多年的老项目做框架和依赖升级。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cf3cg","text":"这不是把“请升级到最新版”丢给模型，然后等它一次性改完。一个比较完整的过程，至少会经历这些轮次：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4fc9i","text":"读取仓库结构和项目规则，确认目标版本与验收标准\n→ 盘点依赖、锁文件、构建脚本和受影响的模块\n→ 分批修改版本配置，先处理核心框架和明确的不兼容 API\n→ 运行构建与测试，读取真实错误和警告\n→ 根据错误继续修复调用方式、类型和配置\n→ 检查关键页面与接口，确认运行时行为没有回退\n→ 整理 diff、升级清单、验证结果和未解决问题","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fdjfm","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fb3m5","text":"第一轮可能只是读文件和搜索调用关系，产物是依赖盘点和影响范围。第二轮修改配置以后，锁文件和 diff 就成了下一轮的输入。运行测试报出的错误，又会告诉模型应该回到哪一个模块继续处理。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d4f56","text":"如果升级跨越多个大版本，中间还可能需要暂停下来确认迁移指南，或者把“先让构建通过”和“再检查页面行为”拆成两个阶段。模型不是一直在后台凭空思考，它是在每次工具调用返回结果以后，基于当前文件、终端输出和任务状态决定下一步。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b09bo","text":"这条链路里，每一步都会产生新东西。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b76mf","text":"升级后的配置、锁文件、修复过的源码、测试日志和检查记录，都会成为后续行动可以读取的依据。最后交付的也不只是一句“升级完成”，而是一组能让人复查的变更和结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7qf03","text":"这才是长任务能稳定推进的关键。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":31,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"caapb","text":"不要让 AI 靠记忆硬撑，要让工作过程留下可以继续使用的东西。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":21,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"e0jqc","text":"03　Session 给任务留下一张工作台","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8hptt","text":"Agents API 里有一个很重要的概念，叫 Session。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4hcdc","text":"它可以理解成一项任务自己的工作台。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"60d0g","text":"你先创建一个 Agent，规定它使用什么模型、遵守哪些要求、可以调用什么工具。真正开始某项工作时，再给它创建一个 Session。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dft7","text":"这项任务产生的消息、状态、工具调用和结果，都会围绕这个 Session 继续积累。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7429q","text":"这样做解决了一个很实际的问题：任务不必绑在某一次请求上。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2a65e","text":"一次性请求通常围绕一次输入返回结果；一个 Agent 任务则可能等待工具结果、接收补充资料，也可能在运行一段时间以后才发现缺少权限，需要分成多个阶段继续推进。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"89pe5","text":"有了 Session，产品可以继续查询它的状态，也可以在原来的任务里补充一句：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":1,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"falba","text":"“先完成接口部分，页面暂时只给方案，不要修改。","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ia8n","text":"Agent 收到新要求后，继续在同一项任务上工作。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ffau6","text":"这和在 Codex 里不断追加要求的体验很接近。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eg1hl","text":"区别在于，Codex 已经把界面、项目和执行过程做好了；Agents API 则让开发者把类似的能力接进自己的产品。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":21,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"41mac","text":"04　工具决定 Agent 能不能真正交付","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dh4pe","text":"即使有模型和 Session，Agent 依然需要工具才能真正完成工作。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"asrct","text":"比如一个代码 Agent，可能需要：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bbg8a","text":"读取仓库文件；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"72ork","text":"搜索函数和调用关系；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"88gd7","text":"修改代码；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ft2p4","text":"运行测试；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"97klh","text":"查看测试结果。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"478fj","text":"一个内容 Agent 需要的工具又不一样：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qdd9","text":"搜索最近的资料；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"946h1","text":"读取过去发布的文章；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3l8r","text":"创建和修改文档；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8sk7a","text":"调用图片模型；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8jc36","text":"检查最终素材。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e2slr","text":"工具不是越多越好。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"etgp3","text":"如果任务只是整理文章，就没有必要给它生产部署权限。如果只需要读取数据，也不应该顺手开放删除和发布能力。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f96d4","text":"更稳妥的做法是按任务开放能力。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"akeai","text":"需要搜索，就给搜索；需要改本地文件，就限制在指定目录；涉及发布、发送、删除和付费操作，再单独由人确认。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e2qe1","text":"Agent 的能力边界越清楚，长任务越容易放心地交出去。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":22,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"6eg0a","text":"05　子 Agent 适合处理彼此独立的部分","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"62fku","text":"Agents API 还支持子 Agent。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5heks","text":"这也是 Codex 处理复杂任务时很有用的一种方式。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1ji6v","text":"例如维护一个独立软件，准备做一次较大的依赖升级，可以把互相独立的前期工作拆开：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"adglk","text":"一个 Agent 查迁移文档、版本兼容性和已知破坏性变更；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"26nfh","text":"一个 Agent 盘点依赖、配置和 API 的调用点，整理受影响的模块；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7cugo","text":"一个 Agent 检查现有测试覆盖、补充关键路径的验收清单并标出风险。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bte4e","text":"它们分别完成以后，再由主 Agent 汇总结论。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e0nep","text":"这种拆法适合并行做资料核对、调用点盘点和风险检查，因为它们的输出可以分别汇总。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3nnd2","text":"但如果让三个 Agent 同时改同一组文件，最后很可能出现互相覆盖的修改或无法判断的冲突。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6j6hs","text":"共享文件的修改仍应串行进行，由主 Agent 统一安排顺序并验收结果。子 Agent 更适合搜索、对比、独立检查和互不重叠的实现。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4l72d","text":"这和带一个小团队差不多。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"asmiv","text":"分工本身不难，难的是每个人交回来的东西能不能拼到一起。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9lrkl","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":16,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"3f02l","text":"06　长任务能不能用，最后看验收","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2bh2b","text":"Agent 做完以后说一句“已经完成”，这件事还没有真正结束。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"87irv","text":"以老项目的框架和依赖升级为例，构建通过只能说明编译或打包链路走通了，不能直接等于任务完成。至少还要继续做几轮验收：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d8pci","text":"跑测试和关键路径，确认核心接口、页面或命令的行为没有回退；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2u7sk","text":"检查运行时日志和实际启动结果，排除只在构建阶段暴露不出来的问题；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e4u1o","text":"审核代码 diff、依赖清单和锁文件，确认没有无关升级或意外改动；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5bfh1","text":"记录仍未解决的兼容性问题、警告和需要人工确认的遗留项。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b2no8","text":"给 Codex 或其他 Agent 下任务时，可以把验收标准直接写进去：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9h6al","text":"请先运行构建和测试，再检查关键接口、页面或命令的运行时结果。\n请审阅代码 diff、依赖清单和锁文件，确认没有无关改动。\n请列出仍未解决的兼容性问题、警告和需要人工确认的遗留项。\n只有完成这些检查，才能报告升级完成。","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b3fe4","text":"这一段往往比堆很多提示词更有用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b118p","text":"它把任务的终点，从“AI 写完了”推进到“结果经过检查并且可以被人接手”。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":29,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"7agfp","text":"07　Codex 和 Agents API 到底是什么关系","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f1chn","text":"Codex 是一个已经做好的 Agent 工作环境。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c02i9","text":"你打开一个项目，把任务交给它，就可以直接查看执行过程、文件改动和最终结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a4ck9","text":"Agents API 面向的是想开发自己产品的人。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"21ie5","text":"开发者需要自己决定：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"l7gp","text":"Agent 放在哪个产品里；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7brrk","text":"能使用哪些工具；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ddlki","text":"怎样在产品里展示和续接任务状态；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1gc2m","text":"怎样展示执行过程；","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9qmae","text":"哪些操作必须等待用户确认。","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e1se0","text":"它们之间最直接的关系，是 Agents API 把支撑 Codex 的同一套 harness 和基础设施带给开发者；开发者需要选择执行环境，并决定产品界面、工具、知识和工作流，也不意味着把 Codex App 嵌入自己的产品。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"e149c","text":"如果你只是想让 AI 帮你完成本地项目，直接使用 Codex 会简单很多。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"907pn","text":"如果你已经在 Codex 里跑通一套稳定工作流，接下来想把这种能力提供给自己的用户，Agents API 才值得继续研究。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":14,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"3pkk","text":"08　这次开放真正改变了什么","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"700te","text":"过去，如果要把一个能持续工作的 Agent 放进产品，开发者往往要自己搭一套 agent loop：管理上下文，调度工具，保存任务状态，再把子 Agent 和执行环境连接起来。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bkvtg","text":"这些工作本身不一定是产品的核心，却决定了 Agent 能不能跨多个步骤稳定推进。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fv69s","text":"Agents API 现在提供了支撑 Codex 的同一套 harness 和基础设施。开发者可以把精力放到真正属于自己产品的部分：接入什么工具，提供哪些知识，怎样设计工作流，以及用户怎样看到过程和结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4n6tv","text":"比如，一个代码维护产品可以让 Agent 处理依赖升级和回归检查；一个数据分析产品可以让 Agent 分派查询、整理证据并生成报告；一个运营系统可以让 Agent 串起资料检索、内容草拟和人工审核。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3s8mj","text":"这些只是通用的产品方向，具体能不能跑通，仍取决于工具、数据、执行环境和验收标准怎么设计。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"833p2","text":"模型会继续变强，但用户最终关心的依然是同一件事：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":32,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"5b4h0","text":"任务交出去以后，过程看得见，遇到问题接得上，最后的结果真的能用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fiv8h","text":"参考资料：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ff6k","text":"Introducing the Agents API｜OpenAI","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3psdl","text":"OpenAI Agents API：创建 Agent","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"70mki","text":"OpenAI Agents API：创建 Session","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8s36o","text":"OpenAI Agents API：查看任务过程","type":"unordered-list-item"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3hj8i","text":"最近发现一个好用的 AI 生图工具，分享一下。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":35,"text":"HiAPI.ai","toIndex":43}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":9,"offset":35,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"1e8m9","text":"写文章、做 PPT、搞 README 配图的时候经常需要快速出一张图，HiAPI.ai 直接输入描述就能出图，也支持生视频，响应很快，出图质量也不错。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"68l34","text":"新注册用户送 50 张 GPT Image 2 免费额度，不用绑卡，需要快速出图的可以试试。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":2,"text":"HiAPI.ai","toIndex":10},{"fromIndex":16,"text":"https://www.hiapi.ai/invite/QwfK","toIndex":48}]},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":47,"offset":2,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"bh53k","text":"👉 HiAPI.ai(直达链接：https://www.hiapi.ai/invite/QwfK)","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":23,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"1nv1n","text":"想了解更多可以加我 vx: 257735 聊。\n","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"gg2j","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cursi","text":"","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"4","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"8f5b0df9-3163-4fab-8839-4075770d3d77","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"13","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2104755096278204416"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"1","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"7410a7de-9503-4cf3-8087-855d37f30129","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"8","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2100395161054580736"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"0","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"af48b88a-6e68-435c-a15f-9eca16ea9ffd","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"6","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2100394997577293824"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"2","value":{"dat